a) If possible, please tell me: (only contracts related to the pandemic/COVID-19) Number of contracts granted ______ and their value $______; 
b) If possible, please tell me: Overtime (related to the pandemic/COVID-19) Number of hours ______ and total amounts paid $______; 
c) If possible, please tell me: All equipment/materials purchased by your department/organization (e.g., tablets, plexiglass, computers, masks, soap, etc.) in connection with the pandemic/COVID-19 $______; 
